489
00:27:42,822 --> 00:27:45,355
Jumpa lagi nanti.

490
00:27:45,378 --> 00:27:46,878
Adegan 14: Pengenalan Keluarga / Memperkenalkan Keluarga Saya

491
00:27:46,878 --> 00:27:50,568
