527
00:30:07,808 --> 00:30:09,688
Taman?

528
00:30:09,712 --> 00:30:11,545
Baguslah!

529
00:30:11,568 --> 00:30:14,207
Taman yang mana?

530
00:30:14,230 --> 00:30:19,564
Taman besar yang berada di pusat bandar.

531
00:30:19,587 --> 00:30:24,323
