632
00:36:02,489 --> 00:36:04,124
Baiklah, saya faham.

633
00:36:04,147 --> 00:36:06,590
Saya akan sampaikan kepada Encik Tanaka.

634
00:36:06,614 --> 00:36:08,694
Tolong bantu saya.

635
00:36:08,718 --> 00:36:12,685
Mark tadi nampak sangat tergesa-gesa.

636
00:36:12,708 --> 00:36:15,741
Sibuklah dia dengan persiapan urusan.

637
00:36:15,764 --> 00:36:22,036
