638
00:36:22,059 --> 00:36:25,116
Badannya tak apa-apa kan?

639
00:36:25,140 --> 00:36:26,550
Memang risau juga.

640
00:36:26,574 --> 00:36:32,857
Dia kata tidur malam-malam ni cukup, tak ada masalah.

641
00:36:32,880 --> 00:36:35,485
