642
00:36:35,509 --> 00:36:41,043
Dia kata Isnin depan akan datang awal.

643
00:36:41,066 --> 00:36:42,866
Baiklah, saya faham.

644
00:36:42,889 --> 00:36:45,364
Isnin nanti kita bual lagi.

645
00:36:45,387 --> 00:36:46,847
Ya.

646
00:36:46,871 --> 00:36:49,204
Pesanan itu saja.

647
00:36:49,227 --> 00:36:51,828
Terima kasih kerana memberitahu.

648
00:36:51,852 --> 00:36:56,866
Sama-sama, kalau ada apa-apa lagi, saya akan beritahu.

649
00:36:56,889 --> 00:36:58,123
Ya.

650
00:36:58,146 --> 00:37:00,346
Tolong bantu saya.

651
